<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Telmex started as hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Telmex started as hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Mexican brokerage Interacciones started coverage of telephone giant Telefonos de Mexico (Telmex) with a hold recommendation.</p>
<p>Analyst Robert E. Hulme said the recomendation was based on the uncertainty of the deregulation of the long distance market that &quot;influences more than the apparent low multiples that the company operates.&quot;</p>
</text>
